}⁡A=\\operatorname{tan}⁡B.$  Suppose that both $∠A$ and $∠B$ are acute."] ["question-3a13b69c-0da2-5493-86d2-76c8bc977240" :question/worked-solution "If both angles are acute and $\\operatorname{cot}⁡A=\\operatorname{tan}⁡B,$ then the angles $∠A$ and $∠B$ must be complementary, and we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(3x+1)^{∘}+(4x-9)^{∘} & ={90}^{∘} \\\\ (7x-8)^{∘} & ={90}^{∘} \\\\ 7x-8 & =90 \\\\ 7x & =98 \\\\ x & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-3a13b69c-0da2-5493-86d2-76c8bc977240" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-3954b075-3cbd-547a-ab25-a35f014d84a8" :answer-field/id #uuid "3954b075-3cbd-547a-ab25-a35f014d84a8"] ["answer-201f479f-c986-5031-a33c-dbafb94414b7" :answer/id #uuid "201f479f-c986-5031-a33c-dbafb94414b7"] ["answer-201f479f-c986-5031-a33c-dbafb94414b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-201f479f-c986-5031-a33c-dbafb94414b7" :answer/value "12"] ["answer-196e30cc-dd4b-56ea-a0b6-1806966dbb09" :answer/id #uuid "196e30cc-dd4b-56ea-a0b6-1806966dbb09"] ["answer-196e30cc-dd4b-56ea-a0b6-1806966dbb09" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-196e30cc-dd4b-56ea-a0b6-1806966dbb09" :answer/value "13"] ["answer-ec8b7699-f736-58a7-a627-e8c62a400d67" :answer/id #uuid "ec8b7699-f736-58a7-a627-e8c62a400d67"] ["answer-ec8b7699-f736-58a7-a627-e8c62a400d67" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ec8b7699-f736-58a7-a627-e8c62a400d67" :answer/value "14"] ["answer-6244bb6c-d4f3-5dc9-b931-a8f929d8ca7e" :answer/id #uuid "6244bb6c-d4f3-5dc9-b931-a8f929d8ca7e"] ["answer-6244bb6c-d4f3-5dc9-b931-a8f929d8ca7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6244bb6c-d4f3-5dc9-b931-a8f929d8ca7e" :answer/value "16"] ["answer-80eac182-2d21-5af9-acc3-8bc865bbba69" :answer/id #uuid "80eac182-2d21-5af9-acc3-8bc865bbba69"] ["answer-80eac182-2d21-5af9-acc3-8bc865bbba69" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-80eac182-2d21-5af9-acc3-8bc865bbba69" :answer/value "17"] ["answer-field-3954b075-3cbd-547a-ab25-a35f014d84a8" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-